WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:31.942
Keep the index. Add a scoring rule.

00:00:31.942 --> 00:01:03.018
Reuse D1–D4 with an explicit analyser

00:01:03.018 --> 00:01:32.256
Same term counts. Different lengths.

00:01:32.256 --> 00:02:06.293
Who gets in, what scores them, how many survive?

00:02:06.293 --> 00:02:46.595
A relevance label does not reveal a formula

00:02:46.595 --> 00:03:19.300
Skip work only when a valid bound permits it

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:53.067
Three controls to keep asking about
